{"accountName": "方方的航空小筑", "author": "方方的航空小筑", "body": null, "content": [{"text": "原创 航空小筑 2026-11-28 20:54 广东", "type": "p"}, {"_imgCount": 1, "caption": "", "src": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/mnFqzbVGyMpuRyJOUCEYq5HiaCoxyfo6rsnscqs7z9aiacTjLyibayibFbLcph0EMHWpGVP7wOzhickRAMJxoe5dn6DHj4ogDQqZb9XJBXXOLOC0/0?wx_fmt=jpeg", "type": "img"}, {"_imgCount": 2, "caption": "", "src": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/mnFqzbVGyMpr5CLUmibpnnAe2aGOAickA2I0RCibx5OL52VGv1ichia8YTGhJDsDBPD2hib4ElxYiaDa2QiccdxiaiarygFfwvJ3z9qo616em1EV5iaqeg/640?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg", "type": "img"}, {"text": "废话不说，直接开整。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "1，确认燃油加油口", "type": "p"}, {"text": "《 歼-35的勤务口盖 》推测：", "type": "p"}, {"_imgCount": 3, "caption": "图片", "src": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/mnFqzbVGyMpic0QY7bR3MBvrsbAuYG5qXL3fvlVBVfSgsHbaYeURm0KIuJ35nicA5LquPwickly9maRESReoT3DIXSVIkSxcIgicBdtxERCt9q8/640?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg&tp=webp&wxfrom=5&wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=4", "type": "img"}, {"_imgCount": 4, "caption": "", "src": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/mnFqzbVGyMra8Q57JyaA9siaxTIzTDgiabRMdpicfjKVm6hibVZHEN6PyOrd2WCOACibhviboyWqjzxDwB2ZXxLRanAG2RB7qcJC44Yqqh6SHeZ78/640?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg", "type": "img"}, {"text": "按今天现场视频来看，歼35AE左侧确认是电缆接口", "type": "p"}, {"_imgCount": 5, "caption": "", "src": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/mnFqzbVGyMoytSmgiaOgRIFmibvRyvPZqotRKxJ3OucAleNSziagDExvLg04lj4nUwE6HpmkMYtpLCuBdnbicQujtc7DClrxIDhG2nl3bZnDFX8/640?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg", "type": "img"}, {"text": "右侧可以确认就是燃油加油口", "type": "p"}, {"_imgCount": 6, "caption": "", "src": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/mnFqzbVGyMo6VpCJUiaKzSK9S8xQKkLqv1PXPD15yP9qJjL617iayibv1z7K0KO0AqODy0aSiatINDQNzfdEWhGnjOAVdXmh1FSWUVZwebU7wII/640?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg", "type": "img"}, {"text": "但是加油口左侧那个面板还是太模糊了，未能确认细节。看看后续还有没有现场高清照片。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "2，优越的着陆性能", "type": "p"}, {"_imgCount": 7, "caption": "", "src": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/mnFqzbVGyMrfp3XTlg9IOsD5sppMPVibb30ZaYDBLZia2Hz92oL0e3zwlice2icUO3ibXCl6XlCLLX8RFmS82Z8UPPYmicyzzp5T4WGlqL9tUeibick/640?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg", "type": "img"}, {"text": "按现场视频估算，接地前速度明显低于典型三代机水平。当然，这个阶段已经是一米平飘阶段，不能等同于平飞，但已足以说明问题。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "这还只是35AE，如果是重点强化低速性能的35过来的话，预计会有更好的表现（当然，海航表现意愿也是因素之一）。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "3，滚转敏捷性", "type": "p"}, {"_imgCount": 8, "caption": "", "src": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/mnFqzbVGyMoJCFru2u9VSgsWwWia2ajp2s6kbjBYdjT4aYiaYL1UPRIsjS3WOd5DTg6MGia1pLjKAQwc69wf0FnfkoklnWOnRASKhhbe0hdgpw/640?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg", "type": "img"}, {"text": "这个通场滚转动作，滚转率不是很大，但进入姿态很快。比起苏27系这类宽间距双发布局飞机来说，滚转敏捷性先天占优。而且需要特别留意其舵面偏转角度（升降副翼和全动平尾）都很小，这说明该机在滚转控制方面还有相当大的裕度。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "4，方向舵疑似未参与纵向配平/操纵", "type": "p"}, {"text": "从视频和现场照片来看，在着陆过程中35AE的方向舵未见偏转迹象。这一点有点出乎意料。到底是时机不对没动作，还是确实没参与纵向操纵/配平，留待后续观察。", "type": "p"}, {"_imgCount": 9, "caption": "", "src": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/mnFqzbVGyMoMHfLiacWxgjGAvMDibtlXTds2jkCS388cUC8Zw1wTPuEaMCD5MjiajKlEHHbWGGUJxQfz1wf30ph8fwZYibdpGVziamrACDia6bkco/640?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg", "type": "img"}, {"text": "跳转微信打开", "type": "p"}], "cover": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/mnFqzbVGyMpuRyJOUCEYq5HiaCoxyfo6rsnscqs7z9aiacTjLyibayibFbLcph0EMHWpGVP7wOzhickRAMJxoe5dn6DHj4ogDQqZb9XJBXXOLOC0/0?wx_fmt=jpeg", "date": "11月28日", "id": "300851180", "summary": "原创 航空小筑 2026-11-28 20:54 广东 \n废话不说，直接开整。 \n1，确认燃油加油口 \n《 歼-35的勤务口盖 》推测： \n按今天现场视频来看，歼35AE左侧确认是电缆接口 \n右侧可以确认就是燃油加油口 \n但是加油口左侧那个面板还是太模糊了，未能确认细节。看看后续还有没有现场高清照片。 \n2，优越的着陆性能 \n按现场视频估算，接地前速度明显低于典型三代机水平。当然，这个阶段已经是一", "title": "珠海航展：歼35AE", "ts": 1795870440000, "url": "https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzAxNjY1MzAzMg==&mid=2247509277&idx=1&sn=816734b4dc98f22bb1bad7f0264b0cc4"}